# kq Rust

Workspace crates: `kq-format` (decoders), `kq-index` (install walk + cache),
`kq-cli` (clap, render, commands). MSRV 1.82.

- Keep CLI exit codes stable (`crates/kq-cli/src/exit.rs`).
- `-i` stays global `--install`. Do not add a colliding short flag.
- Decode by sniffing bytes; do not trust extensions alone.
- `grep` searchable types live in `is_searchable` — update that when adding a text projection.
